============================================

Generated from Cargo.lock with cargo-about for the complete dependency union of
the five supported release targets. Regenerate with:

  cargo about generate scripts/runtime-licenses.hbs --locked --fail \
    --manifest-path crates/basilisk-cli/Cargo.toml \
    --output-file RUST-DEPENDENCY-LICENSES

